.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots
.Nd Neovim-config control plane (dispatcher)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar noun
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a thin dispatcher for the vdots Neovim configuration, mirroring the
platform convention
.Pf ( Ic "zdots <noun>" , Ic "phx {...}" , Ic "adots {sync|status|push}" ) .
Every noun resolves to a
.Pa bin/vdots-<noun>
script or a git verb on
.Pa ~/.config/nvim .
With no noun,
.Nm
runs
.Ic doctor .
.Sh NOUNS
.Bl -tag -width "publish [opts] FILE"
.It Ic doctor Op Fl -json Op Fl -fix
Static health check \(em the "brew doctor" for vdots: config validity, the
read-aloud media-key helper, SwiftBar shim, listen library, Drive sync.
See
.Xr vdots-doctor 1 .
.It Ic ctl Brq check Ns | Ns update Op Ar opts
Runtime probe of the live Neovim config via
.Ic :checkhealth .
See
.Xr vdots-ctl 1 .
.It Ic update Op Ar opts
Update plugins via
.Ic vim.pack ,
prune unmanaged packages, run the regression suite, show the diff.
See
.Xr vdots-update 1 .
.It Ic read Op Ar opts Ar FILE
Read a Markdown file aloud with the macOS
.Xr say 1
engine (headless; the in-editor experience is the
.Ic ;r
keymaps). See
.Xr vdots-read 1 .
.It Ic publish Op Ar opts Ar FILE
Turn a Markdown file into a full listen-along session (chaptered audio,
transcript, captions, readability report, article page) under
.Ev $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR ,
which Google Drive desktop syncs to every device. See
.Xr vdots-publish 1 .
.It Ic listen Ar cmd
Browse the listen library:
.Ic open , rebuild , ls , path , info Ar FILE .
See
.Xr vdots-listen 1 .
.It Ic sync
.Ic git pull --ff-only
in
.Pa ~/.config/nvim .
.It Ic status
.Ic git status --short .
.It Ic push Op Ar opts
.Ic git push .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
.It Ev VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
Listen-library root. Default
.Pa ~/ai/outbox/listen .
.It Ev VDOTS_RAW
Set to
.Ql 1
to publish the file named as-is instead of resolving a
.Pa <base>.spoken.md
sibling.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.config/nvim/doc/vdots-readaloud.txt"
.It Pa ~/.config/nvim/bin/
The dispatched scripts. On
.Ev PATH
via the zdots shell (interim; zdots Z-337 tracks native pickup).
.It Pa ~/.config/nvim/doc/vdots-readaloud.txt
Full read-aloud plugin help.
.Ic :help vdots-readaloud .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr say 1 ,
.Xr vdots-ctl 1 ,
.Xr vdots-doctor 1 ,
.Xr vdots-listen 1 ,
.Xr vdots-publish 1 ,
.Xr vdots-read 1 ,
.Xr vdots-update 1
.Pp
.Ic :help vdots-readaloud
inside Neovim.
